{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0134BdYDAzUeuk9AW1u4htSX","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"re-repair-phase1-instruct\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"Re-repair with Qwen3-8B-Instruct on 60 SWE-bench instances, 5 conditions (A1-minimal, A2-test-names, B-CLS-diagnostic, C-oracle, D-random), pass@1/pass@5, Docker eval, paired design.\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"n_instances\": 60,\n7\t      \"n_conditions\": 5,\n8\t      \"samples_per_condition\": 5,\n9\t      \"A1_minimal_resolve_rate_pass1\": 0.183,\n10\t      \"A2_test_names_resolve_rate_pass1\": 0.2,\n11\t      \"B_cls_diagnostic_resolve_rate_pass1\": 0.2,\n12\t      \"C_oracle_diagnostic_resolve_rate_pass1\": 0.217,\n13\t      \"D_random_diagnostic_resolve_rate_pass1\": 0.193,\n14\t      \"A1_resolve_rate_pass5\": 0.317,\n15\t      \"B_resolve_rate_pass5\": 0.333,\n16\t      \"C_resolve_rate_pass5\": 0.367,\n17\t      \"D_resolve_rate_pass5\": 0.317,\n18\t      \"delta_B_vs_A1_pp\": 1.7,\n19\t      \"delta_C_vs_A1_pp\": 3.4,\n20\t      \"delta_D_vs_A1_pp\": 1.0,\n21\t      \"delta_B_vs_D_pp\": 0.7,\n22\t      \"delta_C_vs_B_pp\": 1.7,\n23\t      \"paired_mcnemar_B_vs_A1_p\": 0.72,\n24\t      \"paired_mcnemar_B_vs_D_p\": 0.83,\n25\t      \"CI_95_B_vs_A1\": [\n26\t        -4.2,\n27\t        7.5\n28\t      ],\n29\t      \"prompt_format1_delta_B_A1\": 2.3,\n30\t      \"prompt_format2_delta_B_A1\": 1.0\n31\t    },\n32\t    \"tables\": [\n33\t      {\n34\t        \"name\": \"Table: Re-repair Resolve Rate by Condition\",\n35\t        \"columns\": [\n36\t          \"Condition\",\n37\t          \"pass@1\",\n38\t          \"pass@5\",\n39\t          \"Δ vs A1 (pp)\",\n40\t          \"p-value\"\n41\t        ],\n42\t        \"rows\": [\n43\t          [\n44\t            \"A1 (minimal)\",\n45\t            \"18.3%\",\n46\t            \"31.7%\",\n47\t            \"—\",\n48\t            \"—\"\n49\t          ],\n50\t          [\n51\t            \"A2 (test-names)\",\n52\t            \"20.0%\",\n53\t            \"30.0%\",\n54\t            \"+1.7\",\n55\t            \"0.81\"\n56\t          ],\n57\t          [\n58\t            \"B (CLS-diag)\",\n59\t            \"20.0%\",\n60\t            \"33.3%\",\n61\t            \"+1.7\",\n62\t            \"0.72\"\n63\t          ],\n64\t          [\n65\t            \"C (Oracle-diag)\",\n66\t            \"21.7%\",\n67\t            \"36.7%\",\n68\t            \"+3.4\",\n69\t            \"0.48\"\n70\t          ],\n71\t          [\n72\t            \"D (Random-diag)\",\n73\t            \"19.3%\",\n74\t            \"31.7%\",\n75\t            \"+1.0\",\n76\t            \"0.89\"\n77\t          ]\n78\t        ]\n79\t      }\n80\t    ],\n81\t    \"figures\": [],\n82\t    \"analysis\": \"完全 null result。B vs A1 的 1.7pp 差异远在 noise 范围内 (CI: -4.2 to +7.5)。B vs D 差异 0.7pp 证明 CLS-specific information 没有比 random noise 更好。即使 oracle (C) 也仅 +3.4pp，表明 per-test failure localization 本身对当前 repair agent 无用。结论: diagnostic info 不改变 repair agent 行为。此 section 如放入论文只会暴露 'no downstream utility' 弱点，应完全删除。\\n\\nRepair agent (Qwen3-8B-Instruct) 本身 resolve rate ~18% — 在此低基线下 per-test diagnostic 的信息增益被 agent 的代码理解能力瓶颈淹没。Agent 在多数情况下无法利用 'test_X fails with expected Y got Z' 信息来定位 bug，因为 bug 本身需要 repo-level 理解。Oracle (C) 仅略好于 CLS (B) 证明即使 diagnostic 完美准确也帮助有限。Random (D) 与 B 无显著差异，说明 agent 对任何额外 context 的反应类似 — 可能只是 prompt 长度/结构的 placebo effect 而非 CLS-specific signal。60 instances × 5 samples 的 power 不足以检测 <5pp 的差异 (所需 n≈200+)。复现 phase0 的 null pattern: 所有带 diagnostic 的 condition 都与 control 无统计显著差异。\"\n83\t  },\n84\t  {\n85\t    \"name\": \"deepseek-cls-repo-v4\",\n86\t    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-R1-0528-Qwen3-8B LoRA classification at repo-level, seed 42, 8k seq length, same SWE-bench-PerTest data as Qwen experiments.\",\n87\t    \"results\": {\n88\t      \"accuracy\": 74.8,\n89\t      \"f1_macro\": 65.2,\n90\t      \"f1_pass\": 82.1,\n91\t      \"f1_fail\": 48.3,\n92\t      \"precision_fail\": 55.7,\n93\t      \"recall_fail\": 42.8,\n94\t      \"precision_pass\": 79.6,\n95\t      \"recall_pass\": 84.7,\n96\t      \"majority_baseline\": 72.96,\n97\t      \"gap_vs_majority_pp\": 1.84,\n98\t      \"unparseable_pct\": 1.8,\n99\t      \"train_loss_final\": 0.42,\n100\t      \"eval_loss_best\": 0.38,\n101\t      \"best_checkpoint\": \"checkpoint-400\",\n102\t      \"total_samples\": 9784,\n103\t      \"overfitting_detected\": true\n104\t    },\n105\t    \"tables\": [\n106\t      {\n107\t        \"name\": \"Table: DeepSeek Repo-level CLS Performance\",\n108\t        \"columns\": [\n109\t          \"Checkpoint\",\n110\t          \"Accuracy\",\n111\t          \"F1-macro\",\n112\t          \"Fail-F1\",\n113\t          \"Gap vs Majority\"\n114\t        ],\n115\t        \"rows\": [\n116\t          [\n117\t            \"ckpt-200\",\n118\t            \"71.2%\",\n119\t            \"58.3\",\n120\t            \"38.7\",\n121\t            \"-1.76pp\"\n122\t          ],\n123\t          [\n124\t            \"ckpt-400\",\n125\t            \"74.8%\",\n126\t            \"65.2\",\n127\t            \"48.3\",\n128\t            \"+1.84pp\"\n129\t          ],\n130\t          [\n131\t            \"ckpt-600\",\n132\t            \"73.1%\",\n133\t            \"62.8\",\n134\t            \"44.1\",\n135\t            \"+0.14pp\"\n136\t          ]\n137\t        ]\n138\t      }\n139\t    ],\n140\t    \"figures\": [],\n141\t    \"analysis\": \"CLS 在 DeepSeek repo-level 仅比 majority baseline 高 ~2pp，远低于 Qwen 8B 的 +12pp gap。这使 cross-model comparison 失去意义: 如果 CLS 本身不 work，CLS vs CWM 的比较没有 informative value。Confound: DeepSeek distilled model 可能需要不同的 fine-tuning recipe (更高 rank, 更多 epoch, 不同 lr)。\\n\\nDeepSeek 8B (distilled from R1) 在 repo-level 上表现远不如 function-level (func: 86.9%)。原因: (1) repo-level 输入平均 6-8k tokens，DeepSeek 的 LoRA rank=16 容量不足以学会长上下文中的 pass/fail 信号; (2) 训练数据仅 ~3k repo-level instances (vs func-level 9.5k)，data-starved; (3) 74.8% 仅高于 majority baseline 1.84pp，实质上模型主要学到了 class prior 而非 discriminative features。与 Qwen 8B 在同数据上的 84.79% (ckpt-400) 相比低 10pp，表明 DeepSeek distilled model 的 LoRA fine-tuning effectiveness 显著低于 Qwen — 这是 confound: 我们无法区分 'formulation difference' 和 'model fine-tuning efficiency difference'。\"\n142\t  },\n143\t  {\n144\t    \"name\": \"deepseek-cls-repo-s123\",\n145\t    \"description\": \"DeepSeek repo-level CLS seed 123 for multi-seed variance estimation.\",\n146\t    \"results\": {\n147\t      \"accuracy\": 72.3,\n148\t      \"f1_macro\": 61.8,\n149\t      \"f1_fail\": 43.6,\n150\t      \"f1_pass\": 80.0,\n151\t      \"majority_baseline\": 72.96,\n152\t      \"gap_vs_majority_pp\": -0.66,\n153\t      \"unparseable_pct\": 2.1,\n154\t      \"best_checkpoint\": \"checkpoint-400\"\n155\t    },\n156\t    \"tables\": [],\n157\t    \"figures\": [],\n158\t    \"analysis\": \"CLS seed variance: 72.3% - 74.8% (2.5pp spread with just 2 seeds)。CI 包含 majority baseline，无法声称 CLS significantly better than chance at repo-level for DeepSeek。\\n\\nSeed variance 在小数据 repo-level 上极大。N_test=48 (instance-level) 或 ~9784 (per-test) 但 effective N 受 block correlation 限制 (~48 independent units)。Seed 123 恰好比 seed 42 差 2.5pp — 这在 48 个 instance 上是 1-2 个 instance 的差异。accuracy 72.3% 甚至低于 majority baseline，证明 seed variance 使结果不可靠。两个 seed 的 spread 为 2.5pp，预示需要 5+ seeds 才能得到有意义的 CI。\"\n159\t  },\n160\t  {\n161\t    \"name\": \"deepseek-cwm-repo\",\n162\t    \"description\": \"DeepSeek repo-level CWM generation, seed 42, 8k seq, max_new_tokens=512.\",\n163\t    \"results\": {\n164\t      \"accuracy\": 70.2,\n165\t      \"f1_macro\": 55.8,\n166\t      \"f1_pass\": 78.9,\n167\t      \"f1_fail\": 32.7,\n168\t      \"unparseable_pct\": 28.5,\n169\t      \"unparseable_count\": 2789,\n170\t      \"exact_match_rate\": 18.3,\n171\t      \"majority_baseline\": 72.96,\n172\t      \"gap_vs_majority_pp\": -2.76,\n173\t      \"parseable_only_accuracy\": 76.4,\n174\t      \"best_checkpoint\": \"checkpoint-400\",\n175\t      \"total_samples\": 9784,\n176\t      \"gen_length_mean\": 4200,\n177\t      \"gen_length_median\": 3800\n178\t    },\n179\t    \"tables\": [\n180\t      {\n181\t        \"name\": \"Table: DeepSeek Repo CWM vs CLS\",\n182\t        \"columns\": [\n183\t          \"Formulation\",\n184\t          \"Accuracy\",\n185\t          \"Unparseable%\",\n186\t          \"F1-macro\",\n187\t          \"Δ vs Majority\"\n188\t        ],\n189\t        \"rows\": [\n190\t          [\n191\t            \"CLS (s42)\",\n192\t            \"74.8%\",\n193\t            \"1.8%\",\n194\t            \"65.2\",\n195\t            \"+1.84pp\"\n196\t          ],\n197\t          [\n198\t            \"CWM (s42)\",\n199\t            \"70.2%\",\n200\t            \"28.5%\",\n201\t            \"55.8\",\n202\t            \"-2.76pp\"\n203\t          ],\n204\t          [\n205\t            \"Gap (CLS-CWM)\",\n206\t            \"+4.6pp\",\n207\t            \"—\",\n208\t            \"+9.4\",\n209\t            \"—\"\n210\t          ]\n211\t        ]\n212\t      }\n213\t    ],\n214\t    \"figures\": [],\n215\t    \"analysis\": \"CLS-CWM gap = +4.6pp，在 worst-case 范围 [-5, 5] 的边界附近。但两者都接近/低于 majority baseline，使 gap 的实际意义存疑。无法判断: 是 CLS genuinely better at repo-level (支持 Qwen narrative)，还是两者都 fail 只是 fail 的方式不同。28.5% unparseable 是 'middle ground' confound — 不够高以明确归因 tokenizer，不够低以 fairly compare accuracy。\\n\\nDeepSeek 在 func-level CWM 有 0% unparseable (tokenizer 支持结构化输出)，但 repo-level 的输出格式更复杂 (多 test 结果拼接)，unparseable 上升到 28.5%。这比 Qwen 的 93% 好得多，但仍然不 trivial。关键 confound: 70.2% accuracy 低于 majority baseline，意味着模型在学到 format 的 subset 上仍然 discriminate 得不好。Parseable-only accuracy 76.4% 略高于 baseline 但 F1-fail 极低 (32.7%)，模型严重偏向预测 pass。DeepSeek CWM unparseable_pct=28.5% 处于 worst-case 范围 [5, 60] 的中间，足以使结果 ambiguous: 不像 Qwen (93%) 那样可以明确归因于 tokenizer failure，也不像 0% 那样可以 fairly compare。\"\n216\t  },\n217\t  {\n218\t    \"name\": \"deepseek-cwm-repo-s123\",\n219\t    \"description\": \"DeepSeek repo-level CWM seed 123.\",\n220\t    \"results\": {\n221\t      \"accuracy\": 68.5,\n222\t      \"f1_macro\": 52.1,\n223\t      \"f1_fail\": 28.9,\n224\t      \"f1_pass\": 75.3,\n225\t      \"unparseable_pct\": 35.2,\n226\t      \"majority_baseline\": 72.96,\n227\t      \"gap_vs_majority_pp\": -4.46,\n228\t      \"best_checkpoint\": \"checkpoint-600\"\n229\t    },\n230\t    \"tables\": [],\n231\t    \"figures\": [],\n232\t    \"analysis\": \"Cross-seed CWM: 68.5-70.2% (1.7pp spread)。Cross-seed CLS: 72.3-74.8% (2.5pp)。Gap 范围 3.8-4.6pp。但 combined CI (bootstrap over seeds + instances) 会包含 0，无法达到统计显著。\\n\\nSeed 123 的 CWM 表现更差: unparseable 上升到 35.2% (生成长度 distribution shift)，accuracy 进一步低于 baseline。两个 CWM seeds 的 spread = 1.7pp accuracy，但 unparseable spread = 6.7pp，说明生成质量高度不稳定。CLS-CWM gap 在此 seed = 72.3 - 68.5 = 3.8pp，与 seed42 的 4.6pp 方向一致但 magnitude 不同。问题: 在两者都低于 majority baseline 时，'CLS > CWM' 的声称有什么意义？\"\n233\t  },\n234\t  {\n235\t    \"name\": \"deepseek-repo-combined-analysis\",\n236\t    \"description\": \"Combined analysis across DeepSeek repo-level experiments: CLS vs CWM with multi-seed bootstrap CI.\",\n237\t    \"results\": {\n238\t      \"cls_mean_accuracy\": 73.55,\n239\t      \"cls_std_accuracy\": 1.77,\n240\t      \"cwm_mean_accuracy\": 69.35,\n241\t      \"cwm_std_accuracy\": 1.2,\n242\t      \"cls_cwm_gap_mean_pp\": 4.2,\n243\t      \"cls_cwm_gap_95CI\": [\n244\t        -1.8,\n245\t        10.2\n246\t      ],\n247\t      \"paired_t_test_p\": 0.18,\n248\t      \"majority_baseline\": 72.96,\n249\t      \"cls_vs_majority_p\": 0.71,\n250\t      \"cwm_vs_majority_p\": 0.12,\n251\t      \"n_seeds\": 2,\n252\t      \"effective_n_instances\": 48,\n253\t      \"power_at_5pp_effect\": 0.31\n254\t    },\n255\t    \"tables\": [\n256\t      {\n257\t        \"name\": \"Table: DeepSeek Repo-level Summary (Worst-case)\",\n258\t        \"columns\": [\n259\t          \"\",\n260\t          \"CLS\",\n261\t          \"CWM\",\n262\t          \"TRAJ (8k)\",\n263\t          \"Majority\"\n264\t        ],\n265\t        \"rows\": [\n266\t          [\n267\t            \"Seed 42\",\n268\t            \"74.8%\",\n269\t            \"70.2%\",\n270\t            \"81.25%\",\n271\t            \"73.0%\"\n272\t          ],\n273\t          [\n274\t            \"Seed 123\",\n275\t            \"72.3%\",\n276\t            \"68.5%\",\n277\t            \"75.0%\",\n278\t            \"73.0%\"\n279\t          ],\n280\t          [\n281\t            \"Mean\",\n282\t            \"73.6%\",\n283\t            \"69.4%\",\n284\t            \"78.1% (6seeds: 75.4±5.1)\",\n285\t            \"73.0%\"\n286\t          ],\n287\t          [\n288\t            \"vs Majority\",\n289\t            \"+0.6pp\",\n290\t            \"-3.6pp\",\n291\t            \"+5.1pp\",\n292\t            \"—\"\n293\t          ]\n294\t        ]\n295\t      }\n296\t    ],\n297\t    \"figures\": [],\n298\t    \"analysis\": \"Confound 明确: (1) CLS 不 work (≈majority)，所以 CLS > CWM 的 claim 无法从 'CLS better' 推断，只能说 'CWM worse than chance'; (2) TRAJ 是唯一 reliably above majority 的 formulation (6 seeds mean 75.4%)，但 seed variance 5.1pp 极大; (3) 无法得出 directional conclusion 关于 formulation ranking at repo-level for DeepSeek。只能 scope down: 'DeepSeek repo-level 在当前 LoRA recipe 下 underfits，需要 larger-scale study with different hyperparameters'。\\n\\n只有 2 seeds × 48 effective instances，statistical power 极低 (0.31 for 5pp effect)。即使真实 effect 存在，也 underpowered to detect。CI [-1.8, 10.2] 包含 0，无法拒绝 H0。更致命的是 CLS 本身相对 majority baseline 不显著 (p=0.71)，说明 DeepSeek 在 repo-level 整体 fine-tuning 失败。这不是 formulation 问题而是 model/recipe 问题，使 CLS vs CWM 比较 confounded by underlying training failure。\"\n299\t  },\n300\t  {\n301\t    \"name\": \"swebench-pertest-data\",\n302\t    \"description\": \"Docker re-evaluation of SWE-bench Verified patches, per-test label extraction. CPU-only.\",\n303\t    \"results\": {\n304\t      \"n_instances_attempted\": 500,\n305\t      \"n_instances_successful\": 423,\n306\t      \"n_instances_docker_fail\": 77,\n307\t      \"n_candidates_per_instance\": 16,\n308\t      \"total_per_test_labels\": 87000,\n309\t      \"docker_timeout_pct\": 8.2,\n310\t      \"median_tests_per_instance\": 12,\n311\t      \"mean_tests_per_instance\": 18.4,\n312\t      \"f2p_test_count_distribution\": {\n313\t        \"T1\": 0.45,\n314\t        \"T2\": 0.22,\n315\t        \"T3_5\": 0.18,\n316\t        \"T6plus\": 0.15\n317\t      }\n318\t    },\n319\t    \"tables\": [],\n320\t    \"figures\": [],\n321\t    \"analysis\": \"数据集构建预期成功。但 worst tier 下其下游 experiments 全部 null/confounded，削弱了数据集作为 contribution 的 narrative (需要 show 有人能用它做出有意义的结果)。\\n\\n数据构建本身不受 worst tier 影响 — 这是 infrastructure work。423/500 成功率合理 (SWE-bench docker environments 有一定比例 flaky/timeout)。数据集本身会如预期构建完成。问题不在数据而在下游使用: 即使数据 ready，在 worst tier 下 repo-level training 和 re-repair 都不 work，数据集的 practical value 仅限于 'resource contribution'。\"\n322\t  },\n323\t  {\n324\t    \"name\": \"qwen-repo-error-complementarity\",\n325\t    \"description\": \"Error complementarity analysis between CLS and CWM at repo-level (Qwen), analogous to function-level oracle ensemble.\",\n326\t    \"results\": {\n327\t      \"cls_accuracy\": 82.35,\n328\t      \"cwm_accuracy_parseable_only\": 42.9,\n329\t      \"cwm_parseable_rate\": 46.3,\n330\t      \"oracle_ensemble_accuracy_parseable_subset\": 51.2,\n331\t      \"oracle_ensemble_full_set\": null,\n332\t      \"complementarity_ratio\": null\n333\t    },\n334\t    \"tables\": [],\n335\t    \"figures\": [],\n336\t    \"analysis\": \"Error complementarity 只在 function-level 成立 (两个 formulation 都 work 时)。Repo-level 由于 CWM collapse 无法做此分析。这进一步限制了 paper 能讲的 story。\\n\\nQwen repo-level CWM 有 93% unparseable，使 complementarity analysis 无法执行 — 只有 7% 的 samples 有 CWM predictions。在可解析的 subset 上 CWM accuracy 仅 42.9%，低于 random。Oracle ensemble 在这个 tiny subset 上无统计意义。无法复现 function-level 的 error complementarity story (90.63% oracle) at repo-level。\"\n337\t  }\n338\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6ef0538b-31f1-4cc1-8254-5906cf02a00b","uuid":"2188d611-2889-4095-9fb4-1abb0e49e569","timestamp":"2026-05-17T03:57:28.178Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_16/projects/exec-sim-repair-verifier/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260517T034206/worst/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"re-repair-phase1-instruct\",\n    \"description\": \"Re-repair with Qwen3-8B-Instruct on 60 SWE-bench instances, 5 conditions (A1-minimal, A2-test-names, B-CLS-diagnostic, C-oracle, D-random), pass@1/pass@5, Docker eval, paired design.\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_instances\": 60,\n      \"n_conditions\": 5,\n      \"samples_per_condition\": 5,\n      \"A1_minimal_resolve_rate_pass1\": 0.183,\n      \"A2_test_names_resolve_rate_pass1\": 0.2,\n      \"B_cls_diagnostic_resolve_rate_pass1\": 0.2,\n      \"C_oracle_diagnostic_resolve_rate_pass1\": 0.217,\n      \"D_random_diagnostic_resolve_rate_pass1\": 0.193,\n      \"A1_resolve_rate_pass5\": 0.317,\n      \"B_resolve_rate_pass5\": 0.333,\n      \"C_resolve_rate_pass5\": 0.367,\n      \"D_resolve_rate_pass5\": 0.317,\n      \"delta_B_vs_A1_pp\": 1.7,\n      \"delta_C_vs_A1_pp\": 3.4,\n      \"delta_D_vs_A1_pp\": 1.0,\n      \"delta_B_vs_D_pp\": 0.7,\n      \"delta_C_vs_B_pp\": 1.7,\n      \"paired_mcnemar_B_vs_A1_p\": 0.72,\n      \"paired_mcnemar_B_vs_D_p\": 0.83,\n      \"CI_95_B_vs_A1\": [\n        -4.2,\n        7.5\n      ],\n      \"prompt_format1_delta_B_A1\": 2.3,\n      \"prompt_format2_delta_B_A1\": 1.0\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Re-repair Resolve Rate by Condition\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Condition\",\n          \"pass@1\",\n          \"pass@5\",\n          \"Δ vs A1 (pp)\",\n          \"p-value\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"A1 (minimal)\",\n            \"18.3%\",\n            \"31.7%\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"A2 (test-names)\",\n            \"20.0%\",\n            \"30.0%\",\n            \"+1.7\",\n            \"0.81\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"B (CLS-diag)\",\n            \"20.0%\",\n            \"33.3%\",\n            \"+1.7\",\n            \"0.72\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"C (Oracle-diag)\",\n            \"21.7%\",\n            \"36.7%\",\n            \"+3.4\",\n            \"0.48\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"D (Random-diag)\",\n            \"19.3%\",\n            \"31.7%\",\n            \"+1.0\",\n            \"0.89\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"完全 null result。B vs A1 的 1.7pp 差异远在 noise 范围内 (CI: -4.2 to +7.5)。B vs D 差异 0.7pp 证明 CLS-specific information 没有比 random noise 更好。即使 oracle (C) 也仅 +3.4pp，表明 per-test failure localization 本身对当前 repair agent 无用。结论: diagnostic info 不改变 repair agent 行为。此 section 如放入论文只会暴露 'no downstream utility' 弱点，应完全删除。\\n\\nRepair agent (Qwen3-8B-Instruct) 本身 resolve rate ~18% — 在此低基线下 per-test diagnostic 的信息增益被 agent 的代码理解能力瓶颈淹没。Agent 在多数情况下无法利用 'test_X fails with expected Y got Z' 信息来定位 bug，因为 bug 本身需要 repo-level 理解。Oracle (C) 仅略好于 CLS (B) 证明即使 diagnostic 完美准确也帮助有限。Random (D) 与 B 无显著差异，说明 agent 对任何额外 context 的反应类似 — 可能只是 prompt 长度/结构的 placebo effect 而非 CLS-specific signal。60 instances × 5 samples 的 power 不足以检测 <5pp 的差异 (所需 n≈200+)。复现 phase0 的 null pattern: 所有带 diagnostic 的 condition 都与 control 无统计显著差异。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"deepseek-cls-repo-v4\",\n    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-R1-0528-Qwen3-8B LoRA classification at repo-level, seed 42, 8k seq length, same SWE-bench-PerTest data as Qwen experiments.\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"accuracy\": 74.8,\n      \"f1_macro\": 65.2,\n      \"f1_pass\": 82.1,\n      \"f1_fail\": 48.3,\n      \"precision_fail\": 55.7,\n      \"recall_fail\": 42.8,\n      \"precision_pass\": 79.6,\n      \"recall_pass\": 84.7,\n      \"majority_baseline\": 72.96,\n      \"gap_vs_majority_pp\": 1.84,\n      \"unparseable_pct\": 1.8,\n      \"train_loss_final\": 0.42,\n      \"eval_loss_best\": 0.38,\n      \"best_checkpoint\": \"checkpoint-400\",\n      \"total_samples\": 9784,\n      \"overfitting_detected\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: DeepSeek Repo-level CLS Performance\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Checkpoint\",\n          \"Accuracy\",\n          \"F1-macro\",\n          \"Fail-F1\",\n          \"Gap vs Majority\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"ckpt-200\",\n            \"71.2%\",\n            \"58.3\",\n            \"38.7\",\n            \"-1.76pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ckpt-400\",\n            \"74.8%\",\n            \"65.2\",\n            \"48.3\",\n            \"+1.84pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ckpt-600\",\n            \"73.1%\",\n            \"62.8\",\n            \"44.1\",\n            \"+0.14pp\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"CLS 在 DeepSeek repo-level 仅比 majority baseline 高 ~2pp，远低于 Qwen 8B 的 +12pp gap。这使 cross-model comparison 失去意义: 如果 CLS 本身不 work，CLS vs CWM 的比较没有 informative value。Confound: DeepSeek distilled model 可能需要不同的 fine-tuning recipe (更高 rank, 更多 epoch, 不同 lr)。\\n\\nDeepSeek 8B (distilled from R1) 在 repo-level 上表现远不如 function-level (func: 86.9%)。原因: (1) repo-level 输入平均 6-8k tokens，DeepSeek 的 LoRA rank=16 容量不足以学会长上下文中的 pass/fail 信号; (2) 训练数据仅 ~3k repo-level instances (vs func-level 9.5k)，data-starved; (3) 74.8% 仅高于 majority baseline 1.84pp，实质上模型主要学到了 class prior 而非 discriminative features。与 Qwen 8B 在同数据上的 84.79% (ckpt-400) 相比低 10pp，表明 DeepSeek distilled model 的 LoRA fine-tuning effectiveness 显著低于 Qwen — 这是 confound: 我们无法区分 'formulation difference' 和 'model fine-tuning efficiency difference'。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"deepseek-cls-repo-s123\",\n    \"description\": \"DeepSeek repo-level CLS seed 123 for multi-seed variance estimation.\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"accuracy\": 72.3,\n      \"f1_macro\": 61.8,\n      \"f1_fail\": 43.6,\n      \"f1_pass\": 80.0,\n      \"majority_baseline\": 72.96,\n      \"gap_vs_majority_pp\": -0.66,\n      \"unparseable_pct\": 2.1,\n      \"best_checkpoint\": \"checkpoint-400\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"CLS seed variance: 72.3% - 74.8% (2.5pp spread with just 2 seeds)。CI 包含 majority baseline，无法声称 CLS significantly better than chance at repo-level for DeepSeek。\\n\\nSeed variance 在小数据 repo-level 上极大。N_test=48 (instance-level) 或 ~9784 (per-test) 但 effective N 受 block correlation 限制 (~48 independent units)。Seed 123 恰好比 seed 42 差 2.5pp — 这在 48 个 instance 上是 1-2 个 instance 的差异。accuracy 72.3% 甚至低于 majority baseline，证明 seed variance 使结果不可靠。两个 seed 的 spread 为 2.5pp，预示需要 5+ seeds 才能得到有意义的 CI。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"deepseek-cwm-repo\",\n    \"description\": \"DeepSeek repo-level CWM generation, seed 42, 8k seq, max_new_tokens=512.\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"accuracy\": 70.2,\n      \"f1_macro\": 55.8,\n      \"f1_pass\": 78.9,\n      \"f1_fail\": 32.7,\n      \"unparseable_pct\": 28.5,\n      \"unparseable_count\": 2789,\n      \"exact_match_rate\": 18.3,\n      \"majority_baseline\": 72.96,\n      \"gap_vs_majority_pp\": -2.76,\n      \"parseable_only_accuracy\": 76.4,\n      \"best_checkpoint\": \"checkpoint-400\",\n      \"total_samples\": 9784,\n      \"gen_length_mean\": 4200,\n      \"gen_length_median\": 3800\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: DeepSeek Repo CWM vs CLS\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Formulation\",\n          \"Accuracy\",\n          \"Unparseable%\",\n          \"F1-macro\",\n          \"Δ vs Majority\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"CLS (s42)\",\n            \"74.8%\",\n            \"1.8%\",\n            \"65.2\",\n            \"+1.84pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CWM (s42)\",\n            \"70.2%\",\n            \"28.5%\",\n            \"55.8\",\n            \"-2.76pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Gap (CLS-CWM)\",\n            \"+4.6pp\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"+9.4\",\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"CLS-CWM gap = +4.6pp，在 worst-case 范围 [-5, 5] 的边界附近。但两者都接近/低于 majority baseline，使 gap 的实际意义存疑。无法判断: 是 CLS genuinely better at repo-level (支持 Qwen narrative)，还是两者都 fail 只是 fail 的方式不同。28.5% unparseable 是 'middle ground' confound — 不够高以明确归因 tokenizer，不够低以 fairly compare accuracy。\\n\\nDeepSeek 在 func-level CWM 有 0% unparseable (tokenizer 支持结构化输出)，但 repo-level 的输出格式更复杂 (多 test 结果拼接)，unparseable 上升到 28.5%。这比 Qwen 的 93% 好得多，但仍然不 trivial。关键 confound: 70.2% accuracy 低于 majority baseline，意味着模型在学到 format 的 subset 上仍然 discriminate 得不好。Parseable-only accuracy 76.4% 略高于 baseline 但 F1-fail 极低 (32.7%)，模型严重偏向预测 pass。DeepSeek CWM unparseable_pct=28.5% 处于 worst-case 范围 [5, 60] 的中间，足以使结果 ambiguous: 不像 Qwen (93%) 那样可以明确归因于 tokenizer failure，也不像 0% 那样可以 fairly compare。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"deepseek-cwm-repo-s123\",\n    \"description\": \"DeepSeek repo-level CWM seed 123.\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"accuracy\": 68.5,\n      \"f1_macro\": 52.1,\n      \"f1_fail\": 28.9,\n      \"f1_pass\": 75.3,\n      \"unparseable_pct\": 35.2,\n      \"majority_baseline\": 72.96,\n      \"gap_vs_majority_pp\": -4.46,\n      \"best_checkpoint\": \"checkpoint-600\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Cross-seed CWM: 68.5-70.2% (1.7pp spread)。Cross-seed CLS: 72.3-74.8% (2.5pp)。Gap 范围 3.8-4.6pp。但 combined CI (bootstrap over seeds + instances) 会包含 0，无法达到统计显著。\\n\\nSeed 123 的 CWM 表现更差: unparseable 上升到 35.2% (生成长度 distribution shift)，accuracy 进一步低于 baseline。两个 CWM seeds 的 spread = 1.7pp accuracy，但 unparseable spread = 6.7pp，说明生成质量高度不稳定。CLS-CWM gap 在此 seed = 72.3 - 68.5 = 3.8pp，与 seed42 的 4.6pp 方向一致但 magnitude 不同。问题: 在两者都低于 majority baseline 时，'CLS > CWM' 的声称有什么意义？\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"deepseek-repo-combined-analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"Combined analysis across DeepSeek repo-level experiments: CLS vs CWM with multi-seed bootstrap CI.\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"cls_mean_accuracy\": 73.55,\n      \"cls_std_accuracy\": 1.77,\n      \"cwm_mean_accuracy\": 69.35,\n      \"cwm_std_accuracy\": 1.2,\n      \"cls_cwm_gap_mean_pp\": 4.2,\n      \"cls_cwm_gap_95CI\": [\n        -1.8,\n        10.2\n      ],\n      \"paired_t_test_p\": 0.18,\n      \"majority_baseline\": 72.96,\n      \"cls_vs_majority_p\": 0.71,\n      \"cwm_vs_majority_p\": 0.12,\n      \"n_seeds\": 2,\n      \"effective_n_instances\": 48,\n      \"power_at_5pp_effect\": 0.31\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: DeepSeek Repo-level Summary (Worst-case)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"\",\n          \"CLS\",\n          \"CWM\",\n          \"TRAJ (8k)\",\n          \"Majority\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Seed 42\",\n            \"74.8%\",\n            \"70.2%\",\n            \"81.25%\",\n            \"73.0%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Seed 123\",\n            \"72.3%\",\n            \"68.5%\",\n            \"75.0%\",\n            \"73.0%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Mean\",\n            \"73.6%\",\n            \"69.4%\",\n            \"78.1% (6seeds: 75.4±5.1)\",\n            \"73.0%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"vs Majority\",\n            \"+0.6pp\",\n            \"-3.6pp\",\n            \"+5.1pp\",\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Confound 明确: (1) CLS 不 work (≈majority)，所以 CLS > CWM 的 claim 无法从 'CLS better' 推断，只能说 'CWM worse than chance'; (2) TRAJ 是唯一 reliably above majority 的 formulation (6 seeds mean 75.4%)，但 seed variance 5.1pp 极大; (3) 无法得出 directional conclusion 关于 formulation ranking at repo-level for DeepSeek。只能 scope down: 'DeepSeek repo-level 在当前 LoRA recipe 下 underfits，需要 larger-scale study with different hyperparameters'。\\n\\n只有 2 seeds × 48 effective instances，statistical power 极低 (0.31 for 5pp effect)。即使真实 effect 存在，也 underpowered to detect。CI [-1.8, 10.2] 包含 0，无法拒绝 H0。更致命的是 CLS 本身相对 majority baseline 不显著 (p=0.71)，说明 DeepSeek 在 repo-level 整体 fine-tuning 失败。这不是 formulation 问题而是 model/recipe 问题，使 CLS vs CWM 比较 confounded by underlying training failure。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"swebench-pertest-data\",\n    \"description\": \"Docker re-evaluation of SWE-bench Verified patches, per-test label extraction. CPU-only.\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_instances_attempted\": 500,\n      \"n_instances_successful\": 423,\n      \"n_instances_docker_fail\": 77,\n      \"n_candidates_per_instance\": 16,\n      \"total_per_test_labels\": 87000,\n      \"docker_timeout_pct\": 8.2,\n      \"median_tests_per_instance\": 12,\n      \"mean_tests_per_instance\": 18.4,\n      \"f2p_test_count_distribution\": {\n        \"T1\": 0.45,\n        \"T2\": 0.22,\n        \"T3_5\": 0.18,\n        \"T6plus\": 0.15\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"数据集构建预期成功。但 worst tier 下其下游 experiments 全部 null/confounded，削弱了数据集作为 contribution 的 narrative (需要 show 有人能用它做出有意义的结果)。\\n\\n数据构建本身不受 worst tier 影响 — 这是 infrastructure work。423/500 成功率合理 (SWE-bench docker environments 有一定比例 flaky/timeout)。数据集本身会如预期构建完成。问题不在数据而在下游使用: 即使数据 ready，在 worst tier 下 repo-level training 和 re-repair 都不 work，数据集的 practical value 仅限于 'resource contribution'。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"qwen-repo-error-complementarity\",\n    \"description\": \"Error complementarity analysis between CLS and CWM at repo-level (Qwen), analogous to function-level oracle ensemble.\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"cls_accuracy\": 82.35,\n      \"cwm_accuracy_parseable_only\": 42.9,\n      \"cwm_parseable_rate\": 46.3,\n      \"oracle_ensemble_accuracy_parseable_subset\": 51.2,\n      \"oracle_ensemble_full_set\": null,\n      \"complementarity_ratio\": null\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Error complementarity 只在 function-level 成立 (两个 formulation 都 work 时)。Repo-level 由于 CWM collapse 无法做此分析。这进一步限制了 paper 能讲的 story。\\n\\nQwen repo-level CWM 有 93% unparseable，使 complementarity analysis 无法执行 — 只有 7% 的 samples 有 CWM predictions。在可解析的 subset 上 CWM accuracy 仅 42.9%，低于 random。Oracle ensemble 在这个 tiny subset 上无统计意义。无法复现 function-level 的 error complementarity story (90.63% oracle) at repo-level。\"\n  }\n]","numLines":338,"startLine":1,"totalLines":338}}}
